# gpu-nvidia: NVIDIA open-kernel driver branch 580 from Ubuntu's own archive (supports RTX 50 / Blackwell).
# Uses DKMS unless a prebuilt linux-modules-nvidia-580-open-<flavour> exists. x86-64 only.
# The installer never touches initramfs or the kernel command line.
nvidia-driver-580-open
libnvidia-egl-wayland1
dkms
linux-headers-generic
